close_reason: "Canonical unbounded pm 2026.8.20 list reads are implemented and locally verified through exact gates plus packed npx/bunx acceptance; GitHub review and delivery remain PR work, while publication remains independently blocked by pmc-t8tj."
body: "TDD sequence: pin exact argv in unit and wrapper tests first; add a real installed-CLI receipt assertion including empty legacy aliases; implement canonical command and unbounded controls; migrate user-facing terminology; upgrade exact SDK/host floors; regenerate the package changelog; run privacy, merge, health, release, packed npm/npx and Bun/bunx acceptance."
